<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Peppa English Tracker - Образовательный проект</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f7f9fa;
            --primary-pink: #ff94b8;
            --duo-green: #58cc02;
            --duo-green-dark: #46a302;
            --card-border: #e5e5e5;
            --text-main: #3c3c3c;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', 'Chalkboard SE', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            margin: 0; padding: 0;
            color: var(--text-main);
            user-select: none;
        }

        header {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e5e5;
            position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: bold; color: var(--primary-pink); }

        .progress-container {
            flex-grow: 1; margin: 0 30px;
            background-color: #e5e5e5; border-radius: 20px; height: 16px;
        }

        .progress-bar {
            width: 0%; height: 100%;
            background-color: var(--duo-green); border-radius: 20px;
            transition: width 0.4s ease;
        }

        .stats { display: flex; gap: 15px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem; }

        .main-layout {
            max-width: 900px; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0 20px;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 25px;
        }

        .video-card {
            background: white; border: 2px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 24px; padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0px var(--card-border);
        }

        .video-card h2 { margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 1.4rem; color: #ff4081; }
        .video-card p { margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: #777; font-size: 1rem; }

        .video-wrapper {
            position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;
            border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid #ddd;
        }

        .video-wrapper iframe {
            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;
        }

        .quiz-card {
            background: white; border: 2px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 24px; padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0px var(--card-border);
        }

        .question-text { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; }

        .cards-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .word-card {
            background: white; border: 2px solid var(--card-border);
            border-bottom: 5px solid var(--card-border); border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 15px; cursor: pointer; text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.1s ease;
        }

        .word-card:active { transform: translateY(3px); border-bottom-width: 2px; }
        .word-card.selected { border-color: #1cb0f6; background-color: #ddf4ff; border-bottom-color: #1cb0f6; }
        .word-card img { width: 100%; height: 100px; object-fit: contain; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .word-card .english-word { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: bold; color: #1cb0f6; }
        .word-card .translation { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #777; margin-top: 4px; }

        .action-btn {
            background-color: var(--duo-green); color: white; border: none;
            border-bottom: 5px solid var(--duo-green-dark); border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer; width: 100%; font-family: inherit;
        }

        .action-btn:active { transform: translateY(4px); border-bottom-width: 1px; }
        .hidden { display: none !important; }
        .win-screen { text-align: center; padding: 40px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">🐷 Peppa Study Project</div>
        <div class="progress-container">
            <div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stats">
            <div>🔥 Уровень: <span id="levelDisplay">1</span>/5</div>
            <div>⭐ Очки: <span id="scoreDisplay">0</span></div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="main-layout" id="gameLayout">
        <div class="video-card">
            <h2 id="lessonTitle">Загрузка урока...</h2>
            <p id="lessonDesc">Посмотри отрывок серии и выполни задание ниже!</p>
            <div class="video-wrapper">
                <iframe id="videoPlayer" src="https://youtube.com" allowfullscreen></iframe>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quiz-card">
            <div class="question-text" id="questionText">Найди правильное слово из видео:</div>
            <div class="cards-grid" id="cardsContainer"></div>
            <button class="action-btn" onclick="checkAnswer()">ПРОВЕРИТЬ ОТВЕТ</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="main-layout hidden" id="victoryScreen">
        <div class="quiz-card win-screen">
            <h2>🎉 Курс успешно завершен! 🎉</h2>
            <p>Этот проект доказал эффективность интерактивного обучения языку с помощью медиа-ресурсов.</p>
            <p style="font-size: 4rem; margin: 20px 0;">👑 📚 🚀</p>
            <button class="action-btn" onclick="resetProgress()">Пройти заново для теста</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

